paused 0
ERROR 1064 (42000) at line 5: the other nodes of cluster 'v1' attached the bulk_import chunk, this node failed and rejoins the cluster by SST: bulk_import chunk #!/[0-9]+/!# of table 't' is not prepared on this node
––– comment –––
Node 3 joins while node 1, the only donor of its segment, has no chunk rows: node 1 refuses to donate, the join fails with the donor's reason and node 3 gets no table
––– input –––
source /tmp/bc.sh; m 3 "JOIN CLUSTER v1 AT '127.0.0.1:1312'"; echo "node 1 $(v 1 node_state) count=$(m 1 "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM t")"; [ -z "$(v 3 node_state)" ] && echo "node 3 not in cluster"
