node 3 not in cluster
––– comment –––
Once the refused donation is over and node 3 left the group, node 4 resumes, the lock is free and node 1 rejoins by SST
––– input –––
source /tmp/bc.sh; L=/var/log/manticore-1/searchd.log; for k in $(seq 120); do grep -q "donate cluster v1 to 127.0.0.1:3312" $L && [ "$(v 2 size)" = 2 ] && break; sleep 0.5; done; echo "size $(v 2 size)"; kill -CONT $P4; wait $UP; for k in $(seq 120); do grep -q "cluster 'v1' rejoin started, attempt 1" $L && break; sleep 0.5; done; waitsynced 1 2; echo "synced $?"
